    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--1\"><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><div style=\"BORDER-TOP:medium none;BORDER-RIGHT:medium none;BORDER-BOTTOM:#b79c61 1pt solid;PADDING-BOTTOM:1pt;PADDING-TOP:0cm;PADDING-LEFT:0cm;BORDER-LEFT:medium none;PADDING-RIGHT:0cm;mso-element:para-border-div\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"BORDER-TOP:medium none;BORDER-RIGHT:medium none;BORDER-BOTTOM:medium none;PAGE-BREAK-AFTER:avoid;PADDING-BOTTOM:0cm;PADDING-TOP:0cm;PADDING-LEFT:0cm;BORDER-LEFT:medium none;PADDING-RIGHT:0cm;mso-out1ine-1evel:3;mso-pagination:widow-orphan lines-together;mso-line-height-alt:0pt;mso-padding-alt:0cm 0cm 1.0pt 0cm;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #B79C61 1.0pt\"><strong>氣元素Air Elemental</strong></p></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:yes\">   </span> 氣元素是一個有着模糊面孔的漏斗狀螺旋氣流雲。儘管氣元素喜歡在地面上移動並帶起大量塵土碎屑，但是它確實可以飛起並從空中發動攻擊。 <span lang=\"EN-US\"><br /></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:yes\">   </span>氣元素可以將自身變成一陣呼嘯的狂風，並以此生成一股旋風將敵人吹飛。</p><p>元素<span lang=\"EN-US\">Elementals</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:yes\">    </span>元素們是構成宇宙之氣火水土等元素的化身。它們身處其所屬位面時幾乎只是活化的能量，但卻可以應施法者或其他強大存在召來而獲得形體，並執行某些任務。</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:yes\">    </span><em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\"><strong>活體元素</strong></em><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-fareast-font-family:黑體\"><em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\"><strong>Living Elements</strong></em></span><em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\"><strong>。</strong></em>元素在其原生位面是一股沒有形體的生命原力。其形體曖昧不清而只有被魔法力量集中時纔會表現出具體的外形。一隻野生的元素原力精魄只有趨向其原生位面的本能。這些元素精魄就好比物質位面的野獸，它們沒有文化性或社會性，也只有極少的智能。</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:yes\">    </span><em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\"><strong>魔法驅喚</strong></em><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-fareast-font-family:黑體\"><em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\"><strong>Conjured by Magic</strong></em></span><em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\"><strong>。</strong></em>某些法術或者魔法物品可以驅使元素生物，將它從內層位面召喚到物質位面來。這些元素生物本能的厭惡這種將其從原生位面強行拉走使役的行爲。因而這些召喚元素生物者都必須擁有強大的意志以施控制。</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:yes\">    </span><em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\"><strong>約束與定型</strong></em><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-fareast-font-family:黑體\"><em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\"><strong>Bound and Shaped</strong></em></span><em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\"><strong>。</strong></em>強力的法術可以將元素精魄注入一些物質模板中以實現特殊的用途或履行特定的職能。隱形追獵者<span lang=\"EN-US\">invisible stalker</span>是被以特殊形式束縛的氣元素，而水元素則可以以同樣的方式塑形爲水詭<span lang=\"EN-US\">water weird</span>。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><br /></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:yes\">    </span>成型時所使用的魔法和物質本身的強弱決定了該元素生物被約束時的狀態。魔像<span lang=\"EN-US\">golem</span>便是將元素精魄束縛在物質中的形態。不過，諸如血肉和泥土等弱效物質不足以充分的承載元素的力量。而像鐵與石這樣的強效物質則需要更強力的魔法以實現約束，而其效果也更爲牢靠。</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:yes\">    </span><em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\"><strong>元素本質</strong></em><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-fareast-font-family:黑體\"><em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\"><strong>Elemental Nature</strong></em></span><em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\"><strong>。</strong></em>元素生物不需要呼吸，飲食和睡眠。</p><p></p><p>An air elemental is a funneling cloud of whirling air with a vague semblance of a face. Although it likes to race across the ground, picking up dust and debris as it goes, it can also fly and attack from above.</p><p>An air elemental can turn itself into a screaming cyclone, creating a whirlwind that batters creatures even as it flings them away.</p></div></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Elementals\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--0\"><h1 class=\"rd__h rd__h--0\" data-title-index=\"1\"><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Elementals</span></h1><p>Elementals are incarnations of the elements that make up the universe: air, earth, fire, and water. Though little more than animated energy on their own planes of existence, they can be called on by spellcasters and powerful beings to take shape and perform tasks.</p><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--1\"><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Living Elements\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Living Elements.</span> On its home plane, an elemental is a bodiless life force. Its dim consciousness manifests as a physical shape only when focused by the power of magic. A wild spirit of elemental force has no desire except to course through the element of its native plane. Like beasts of the Material Plane, these elemental spirits have no society or culture, and little sense of being.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Conjured by Magic\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Conjured by Magic.</span> Certain spells and magic items can conjure an elemental, summoning it from the Inner Planes to the Material Plane. Elementals instinctively resent being pulled from their native planes and bound into service. A creature that summons an elemental must assert force of will to control it.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Bound and Shaped\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Bound and Shaped.</span> Powerful magic can bind an elemental spirit into a material template that defines a specific use and function. Invisible stalkers are air elementals bound to a specific form, in the same way that water elementals can be shaped into water weirds.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Elemental Nature\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Elemental Nature.</span> An elemental doesn't require air, food, drink, or sleep.</p></div></div></div></div>",
