    {
      "_id": "tElbkTmCHCEPbDcK",
      "name": "旋風 Whirlwind",
      "type": "feat",
      "system": {
        "source": {
          "custom": "",
          "book": "MM'14",
          "page": "124",
          "license": "",
          "rules": "2014",
          "revision": 1
        },
        "description": {
          "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p>每一個身處氣元素所在位置的生物都必須進行一次DC 13的力量豁免。豁免失敗者將受到15（3d8+2）點鈍擊傷害，並以氣元素爲原點從其所在地向隨機方向擊飛20尺，然後應擊倒地。如果目標因此撞到諸如牆壁地板之類的物件，則目標已被擊飛的距離每減少10尺就受到3（1d6）點鈍擊傷害。如果目標因此撞到生物，則該生物必須進行一次DC 13的敏捷豁免，豁免失敗則受到和目標二次傷害等量的傷害，並應擊倒地。<br /><span style=\"mso-spacerun:yes\">  </span>豁免成功則該鈍擊傷害減半且不再被擊飛和因此而倒地。</p><p>Each creature in the elemental's space must make a [[/save ability=str dc=13]] saving throw. On a failure, a target takes 15 ([[/damage 3d8 + 2 type=bludgeoning]]) damage and is flung up 20 feet away from the elemental in a random direction and knocked &amp;Reference[condition=prone]. If a thrown target strikes an object, such as a wall or floor, the target takes 3 ([[/damage 1d6 type=bludgeoning]]) damage for every 10 feet it was thrown. If the target is thrown at another creature, that creature must succeed on a [[/save ability=dex dc=13]] saving throw or take the same damage and be knocked &amp;Reference[condition=prone].</p><p>If the saving throw is successful, the target takes half the bludgeoning damage and isn't flung away or knocked &amp;Reference[condition=prone].</p></div>",
          "chat": ""
        },
        "requirements": "",
